# Copy to .dev.vars for local development. All optional.
# Without ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, change summaries fall back to a heuristic
# (line counts + changed-line excerpts) instead of AI summaries.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=""
# Override the summary model, e.g. claude-haiku-4-5 to cut summarization cost.
SUMMARY_MODEL=""
# Lemon Squeezy webhook signing secret (enables /api/webhooks/lemonsqueezy).
LEMONSQUEEZY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=""
